tools/qwen3_tts: model package build, detector calibration, client, README

Builds the Qwen3-TTS NPU model package flm loads (talker AWQ+GPTQ Q4NX,
code predictor Q4NX, host tensors, speech decoder, tokenizer, package.json
with the garble detector settings) from the Hugging Face checkpoint;
calibrates the detector's entropy threshold on the NPU; test client for the
speech endpoints; README (build, run, API, limitations).
Python only; nothing here is built or installed by CMake.

